graph LR
    SDK["kubeflow-sdk<br/>(pip: kubeflow 0.5.0)"]

    %% Lineage / delivery
    Upstream["kubeflow/sdk<br/>(upstream)"] -->|daily merge sync| SDK
    SDK -->|vX.Y.Z+rhaiv.N wheel| AIPCC["AIPCC Python index"]
    AIPCC -->|installed in| Workbench["Workbench images"]
    AIPCC -->|installed in| UTI["Universal training image"]

    %% Core Python dependencies
    SDK -->|K8s API client| K8sPy["kubernetes >=27.2,<36"]
    SDK -->|typed models| Pydantic["pydantic >=2.10"]
    SDK -->|HTTPS status| Requests["requests >=2.25"]
    SDK -->|Trainer CRD models| TrainerAPI["kubeflow-trainer-api ==2.3.0"]
    SDK -->|Katib CRD models| KatibAPI["kubeflow-katib-api 0.19.x"]
    SDK -->|logging| Structlog["structlog >=24.1"]

    %% Optional extras
    SDK -.->|rhai extra| S3fs["fsspec / s3fs"]
    SDK -.->|spark extra| PySpark["pyspark-client ==4.0.4"]
    SDK -.->|spark extra| SparkAPI["kubeflow-spark-api 2.4.x"]
    SDK -.->|hub extra| MRPy["model-registry 0.3.x"]
    SDK -.->|pipelines extra| KFPPy["kfp kubernetes 2.17.x"]
    SDK -.->|docker / podman extras| Docker["docker / podman"]

    %% Internal platform dependencies
    SDK -->|TrainJob CRD + status API + metrics| Trainer["Kubeflow Trainer"]
    SDK -->|Experiment / Trial CRD| Katib["Katib<br/>(not yet shipped in RHOAI)"]
    SDK -->|SparkConnect / SparkApplication + gRPC| SparkOp["Spark Operator"]
    SDK -->|REST| ModelRegistry["Model Registry"]
    SDK -->|REST| DSP["Data Science Pipelines"]
    SDK -->|reads keys| DataConn["Dashboard Data Connections"]
    SDK -->|generated code runs in| TrainingHub["Training Hub / universal image"]

    %% External services
    SDK -->|API server| K8sAPI["Kubernetes API"]
    SDK -->|checkpoints / models| S3["S3 storage"]
    SDK -->|runtime pip install| PyPIExt["PyPI"]
    SDK -->|models / datasets| HFHub["HuggingFace Hub"]

